  translation {
    text: "Affected southbound trips:\r\n9:27 am from Peoria Station\r\n\nAffected northbound trips:\r\n10:45 am from Ridgegate Parkway Station\r\n\nAffected stops:\r\nNine Mile Station\r\nIliff Station\r\nFlorida Station\r\nAurora Metro Center Station\r\n2nd Ave & Abilene Station\r\n13th Ave Station\r\nColfax Station\r\nFitzsimons Station\r\nPeoria Station"
